Controls:
W, A, S, D - movement
1, 2, 3, 4 - switch weapons
G - hold to throw grenade
left click - shoot
shift - hold to run
space - jump

Steam Multiplayer:
The multiplayer developed within this project was developed using multiple packages and the help
of the steam environment to facilitate connections between players. This method of connection is
a peer to peer system and allows your friends on steam to join.
Packages used:
Mirror: A multiplayer package supplied by Unity to have access to network components
Steamworks.NET: A steam API package used to handle getting info from steam users such as friends list
FizzySteamworks: A small open source package used to connect Mirrors functionality with Steamworks API

